est bus stop to the Elm/Oak corner in Massachusetts. The identified stop (\"Elm Street & Oak Street\" in Amesbury, MA) is verified through the intersection search, the place detail panel, and the proximity search where it ranks first — fully satisfying the instruction.\n\n**Verdict: SUCCESS**",
